# TM modes are weaker confined: lower index than TE at the same thickness.
# Reference: SciPy root of the TM dispersion relation.
title 220 nm silicon slab, TM polarisation
stack core=0.22
polarisation tm
grating angle=10 etch=0.05
expect n_full 2.05331968 2e-07
expect n_etched 1.70157979 2e-07
expect n_grating 1.87744974 2e-07
expect group_index 3.30718313 0.0002
